          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for parse config",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for parse config\n\nlod_qos_parse_config() turns a suggested striping buffer (plain\nV1/V3, or composite COMP_V1) from an application or the per-directory\ndefault into the object's ldo_comp_entries[], applying filesystem\ndefaults and validating it via lod_verify_striping(). It was\nuntested.\n\nAdd lod_parse_config_test.c, covering a NULL buffer (no-op), a plain\nV1 suggestion with filesystem defaults filled in, a V3 suggestion\nnaming a pool, a two-entry COMP_V1 composite layout, and an\nunrecognized magic (rejected, no striping left behind). The function\nnever instantiates stripe objects itself, so the test context is\nlightweight, reusing the same in-memory lod_device/lod_object setup\nas lod_verify_test.c, with no dt_object/thandle mock needed.\n\nExport lod_qos_parse_config(), needed by the new test module, and\nregister it in lustre/kunit/Makefile, KUNIT.modules_list and\nlod/KUNIT.list.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [claude-code]\nChange-Id: I963e2b39c69f3188c7d0a1922007ff707c5a8d40\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
